WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:01.343
- All right.

00:00:01.343 --> 00:00:02.760
We've been all music all hour,

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.100
and we've got one more musical
story to finish things up.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.303
This is "What I'm Liking."

00:00:06.303 --> 00:00:08.467
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:10.101
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:00:10.101 --> 00:00:12.450
A little over a year ago
a group of guys in Sweden

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.400
were hanging out at a bachelor party

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.410
when they decided to start singing.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.550
Unbeknownst to the group,

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.710
one of the men recorded the whole scene,

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.150
and put it up on Tik Tok

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:22.470
just to show a friend.

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:24.540
But more than one friend saw the video.

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.270
In a few hours, tens of
thousands had watched.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:29.760
To date 22 million have.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.800
Since then they've
become an official group

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:32.850
called Dad Harmony.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:35.070
They perform on radio shows and tour,

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:36.480
and they still post videos

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.103
like this amazing NSYNC cover.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.579
♪ No man, no cry ♪

00:00:42.579 --> 00:00:45.114
♪ Maybe that's why ♪

00:00:45.114 --> 00:00:48.749
♪ Every little thing I do ♪

00:00:48.749 --> 00:00:52.531
♪ Never seemed enough for you ♪

00:00:52.531 --> 00:00:56.430
♪ You don't wanna lose it again ♪

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.789
♪ But I'm not like them ♪

00:00:58.789 --> 00:01:03.074
♪ Baby when you finally ♪

00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:06.194
♪ Get to love somebody ♪

00:01:06.194 --> 00:01:08.301
♪ Guess what ♪

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:11.061
♪ It's gonna be me ♪

00:01:11.061 --> 00:01:12.126
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:01:12.126 --> 00:01:14.570
- Just hanging out with
little Spiderman on his lap.

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:16.920
We have this amazing harmonizing dads

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:18.030
on the line right now.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:20.520
Everybody say hello to
Sebastian, Peter, Adam,

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:21.669
Thomas and Michael.

00:01:21.669 --> 00:01:24.960
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:25.993
What's up, y'all?

00:01:25.993 --> 00:01:27.960
I'm gonna start with, look,

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:29.790
I wanna know who's singing that bass?

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:31.050
Who's holding that down?

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:32.520
Which one of you has got that voice?

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:33.360
Come on, now.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:34.816
- It's me.

00:01:34.816 --> 00:01:35.670
♪ Hey ♪

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:37.950
- That's a sexy voice man.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:38.783
Sexy bass.

00:01:38.783 --> 00:01:40.885
Well Peter, I'm gonna start with you.

00:01:40.885 --> 00:01:44.520
First, how did this video happen?

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:45.393
Who posted it?

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.470
- Yeah, it started at my bachelor party.

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.970
We were in a hot tub,

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:53.910
and we sang the song "The Weatherman"

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:56.640
as we usually do when
we are with each other.

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:59.490
And my brother Thomas was posting this

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:03.240
on Tik Tok with his, I think,
seven followers at that time.

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:05.190
And it all exploded,

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:08.070
and now we have 22 million.

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:11.070
- I love that you dudes were just

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:12.780
hanging out in the hot tub,

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:15.780
and you were like "We
should probably sing."

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:16.613
I love it.

00:02:16.613 --> 00:02:19.110
So, Sebastian, Adam, now you're performing

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:20.460
and you're touring, right?

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:21.293
- Yeah.

00:02:21.293 --> 00:02:22.918
I mean after it went viral

00:02:22.918 --> 00:02:27.120
we got invited to various morning shows

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.490
on television and radio around the world.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:32.370
And from then on it just kept going,

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:35.369
and now we're also doing live shows.

00:02:35.369 --> 00:02:39.360
- Unfortunately we do not bring
the kids with us on stage,

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.810
but they love to join
us when we sing at home.

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:44.070
- I know, I love Spiderman

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:46.410
just lying on the lap in the video.

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.243
It's just a good...

00:02:47.243 --> 00:02:48.660
Firetrucks, there's everything.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:49.679
It's just amazing.

00:02:49.679 --> 00:02:51.540
Well you sound beautiful.

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:54.210
Your harmonies are incredible.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:55.590
Thank you so much for posting,

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:56.610
and inspiring all of us.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:57.450
And keep singing.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.163
I'm liking your post right now.

00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:01.764
(bell dings)
And that's not all.

00:03:01.764 --> 00:03:02.639
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:03:02.639 --> 00:03:03.472
Our season one partner Pilot Pen,

00:03:03.472 --> 00:03:05.280
makers of Precise, the go to pen

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:06.360
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:08.280
want to honor truly unstoppable dads

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:09.113
just like y'all.

00:03:09.113 --> 00:03:10.890
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.983
for $1,000 which I think is about

00:03:12.983 --> 00:03:16.395
10,5000 Swedish Kroner.

00:03:16.395 --> 00:03:18.690
So split that up how you will.

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:21.209
Thank you guys so much for joining us.

00:03:21.209 --> 00:03:22.740
And thank you to all our guests this hour,

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.300
Justin Timberlake, Troy,
Cassana, (indistinct).

00:03:27.421 --> 00:03:28.254
Have a great day,

00:03:28.254 --> 00:03:29.322
and if it's not change it.

00:03:29.322 --> 00:03:30.180
(audience cheering and applauding)

